(THE PRICE OF COMMON LABOR.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Like the price of every commodity, the immediate wages of common labor) Tj T*
(is determined by the relation of the demand and supply of labor. Other) Tj T*
(circumstances being the same, every great plague[160-1] or) Tj T*
(emigration[160-2] is wont, by decreasing the supply, to increase the) Tj T*
(wage's of labor; and a plague, the wages of the lowest kind of labor) Tj T*
