(supply are generally much more numerous than those who want it; while) Tj T*
(the reverse is the case with most other commodities. Another important) Tj T*
(peculiarity of the "commodity" labor, is, that it can seldom be bought,) Tj T*
(without at the same time reducing the person of the seller to a species) Tj T*
(of dependence. Thus, for instance, the seller cannot be in a place) Tj T*
(different from that in which his commodity is. Hence a change in the) Tj T*
(person, etc. of the buyer very readily necessitates in the workman a) Tj T*
(radical change of life, and that the levelling adjustment of local) Tj T*
(excess and want is rendered so difficult in the case of this) Tj T*
(commodity.[160-7] Hence, it is that, if in the long run the exchange of) Tj T*
(labor against wages is to be an equitable one \(§ 110\), the master of) Tj T*
