(The demand for labor, as for every other commodity, depends, on the one) Tj T*
(hand, on the value in use of it, and on the other, on the purchaser's) Tj T*
(capacity to pay for it \(his solvability\), These two elements determine) Tj T*
(the maximum limit of wages, as the means of support considered) Tj T*
(indispensable by the workmen determine the minimum. There are) Tj T*
(circumstances conceivable under which the rise in wages might entirely) Tj T*
(eat up rents; but there must always be a portion of the national income) Tj T*
(reserved to reward capital \(its profit\). If wages were to absorb the) Tj T*
(latter also, the mere owner of capital would cease to have any interest) Tj T*
(in the progress of production. Capital would then be withdrawn from) Tj T*
(employment and consumed.[165-1] Obviously, no man engaged in any) Tj T*
(enterprise can give more as wages to his workmen than their work is) Tj T*
(worth to him.[165-2] Hence the additional product in any branch of) Tj T*
(industry, due to the labor of the workman last employed, has a) Tj T*
(controlling influence on the rate of the wages which can be paid to his) Tj T*
(fellow workmen. If the additional products of the workmen successively) Tj T*
(last employed constitute a diverging series,[165-3] the last term in the) Tj T*
(series is the natural expression of the unsurpassable maximum of wages;) Tj T*
(if they constitute a converging series, men the employer can pay the) Tj T*
(last workman higher wages than the additional product due to him;) Tj T*
(provided, however, that the reduction which is to be expected in the) Tj T*
(case of the workmen previously employed to the same level still leaves) Tj T*
(him a sufficiently high rate of profit.[165-4] Hence the growing skill) Tj T*
(of a workman, in and of itself, makes an increase of his wages) Tj T*
(possible;[165-5] while, conversely, if he can be replaced by capital,) Tj T*
(which always relatively decreases the value in use of his labor, there) Tj T*
(is a consequent pressure on his wages.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
