(In the case of a commodity as universally desired as human labor is, the) Tj T*
(idea of the purchasers' capacity to pay \(solvability\) must be nearly) Tj T*
(commensurate with the national income, or to speak more correctly, with) Tj T*
(the world's income.[166-1] In regard to the different kinds of labor,) Tj T*
(and especially to common labor, it is evident that the different kinds) Tj T*
(of consumption require very different quantities of them. Here,) Tj T*
(therefore, we depend on the direction which national consumption takes,) Tj T*
(and this in turn is most intimately related to the distribution of the) Tj T*
(national income.[166-2] If all workmen were employed in nothing but the) Tj T*
(production of articles consumed by workmen, the rate of wages would be) Tj T*
(determined almost exclusively by the ratio between the number of the) Tj T*
(working population and the amount of the national income. But, if this) Tj T*
(were the case, landowners and capitalists would be obliged to live just) Tj T*
(as workmen do, and their highest luxury would have to consist in feeding) Tj T*
(idlers. \(§ 226\). The effect must be much the same, when the wealthy are) Tj T*
(exceedingly frugal and employ their savings as rapidly as possible in) Tj T*
(the employment of common home labor; while, on the other hand, the) Tj T*
(exportation of wheat, wood, and other articles, which the working) Tj T*
(classes consume, in exchange for diamonds, lace, champagne, diminishes) Tj T*
(the efficient demand for common labor in a country.[166-3]) Tj T*
() Tj T*
