(RATE OF WAGES.--INFLUENCE OF CUSTOM.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Custom always exerts a great influence where there is question of) Tj T*
(choosing an avocation with the intention of devoting one's self to it) Tj T*
(entirely and exclusively. There is a public opinion which fixes the) Tj T*
(gradation of the different classes of labor and their appropriate) Tj T*
(reward, which is slow to change, and which both determines, and is) Tj T*
(determined by the relation of supply and demand. There is an equilibrium) Tj T*
(between the pleasantness of work and the rate of wages only in the case) Tj T*
(of such kinds of labor as are on the same social footing. It frequently) Tj T*
(happens, however, that the most repulsive work has to be performed by) Tj T*
(those who are forced to accept any pay and to be satisfied with) Tj T*
(it.[170-1] There are many branches of labor those engaged in which still) Tj T*
(form a kind of exclusive caste; and the pay of the higher branches is) Tj T*
(maintained at a high rate, especially by the fact that the members of) Tj T*
(the castes to which they belong are provident in their marriages. The) Tj T*
(lower classes are not in a condition to meet the preparation necessary) Tj T*
(to engage in such professions, even if they were certain of being) Tj T*
(afterwards reimbursed with interest for the outlay.[170-2] One of the) Tj T*
(chief causes of the lowness of wages paid to women is, that so few) Tj T*
(branches of labor are traditionally open to them, that the few that are,) Tj T*
(are intended to supply luxuries, and are, besides, for the most part,) Tj T*
(over-crowded. The distribution of the aggregate wages earned by any) Tj T*
(industry, among the higher and lower classes of workmen who coöperate in) Tj T*
(it, depends very largely on their social position relatively to one) Tj T*
(another.[170-3] [170-4] Here political forms and changes may exert the) Tj T*
(greatest influence.[170-5]) Tj T*
