(In very low stages of civilization, where there is scarcely any such) Tj T*
(thing as rent, and where capital is extremely rare, the wages of labor,) Tj T*
(notwithstanding its small amount absolutely speaking, must eat up the) Tj T*
(greatest part of the product.[171-1] With every further advance, the) Tj T*
(condition of the laboring class is modified, according as the natural) Tj T*
(decline in this relative amount of their wages is outweighed or) Tj T*
