(intended in the interest of the upper classes to prevent the lower) Tj T*
(obtaining the full advantage of their freedom under the favoring) Tj T*
(circumstances of competition.[175-1] In later times, another cause has) Tj T*
(frequently been added to this, viz.: by diminishing the cost of) Tj T*
(production to increase foreign sales. \(See § 106.\) In the higher stages) Tj T*
(of civilization, nations will scarcely look with favor on the diminution) Tj T*
(of the rightful, for the most part, individually small gains of the most) Tj T*
(numerous, the poorest and most care-worn class of the community.[175-2]) Tj T*
(The purchasers of labor would, in consequence, be badly served, since) Tj T*
(they would have lost the possibility of obtaining better workmen by) Tj T*
(paying higher wages. Hence, there would, probably, be none but mediocre) Tj T*
(labor to be found.[175-3] On the other hand, fixed rates which keep) Tj T*
