(required. But as useful labor always finds purchasers \(the word "useful") Tj T*
(being here employed in the sense of the entire economy of a people, and) Tj T*
(understood in the light of the proper gradation of wants and the means) Tj T*
(of satisfying them\), such a right to labor means no more and no less) Tj T*
(than that the state should force labor which no one can use, upon) Tj T*
(others.[178-2] Something similar is true of Louis Blanc's proposition) Tj T*
(that the rate of wages of the workmen should be determined and regulated) Tj T*
(by their own votes and among themselves.[178-3]) Tj T*
