(Midway between these classes of obstacles lies the very usual proceeding) Tj T*
(of highly civilized nations whose rate of interest is low, to transfer) Tj T*
(their capital into countries with a higher rate of interest, where the) Tj T*
(production of raw material is predominant.[187-1] This is most) Tj T*
(thoroughly accomplished by the emigration for good of the capitalists) Tj T*
(themselves; but also least frequently, because the natural attachment of) Tj T*
(man to his native country is usually too powerful, among the well-to-do) Tj T*
(classes, to be overcome by the attraction of a higher rate of interest.) Tj T*
