(SECTION CXCV.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(THE REWARD OF ENTERPRISE.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The essence of an enterprise or undertaking, in the politico-economical) Tj T*
(sense of the word, consists in this, that the undertaking party engages) Tj T*
(in production for the purpose of commerce, at his own risk. In the) Tj T*
(earlier stages of a nation's economy, the production of consumers is,) Tj T*
(naturally enough, limited chiefly by their own personal wants. Somewhat) Tj T*
(later, when the division of labor has been further developed, the) Tj T*
(workman produces at first, enough to meet occasional determinate) Tj T*
("orders;" and still later to meet them regularly and as a business.) Tj T*
