(     revolts. It originated among the most dangerous class of) Tj T*
(     slaves, most dangerous because best prepared for the) Tj T*
(     struggle, the gladiators, and among the immense _ergastula_,) Tj T*
(     where they were held together in large masses. It spread) Tj T*
(     with frightful rapidity, because the combustible material on) Tj T*
(     which it fed was everywhere to be found. It was conducted) Tj T*
(     with the most revolting cruelty. What the slaves demanded) Tj T*
(     before all else was vengeance, and what dread had a) Tj T*
(     gladiator of a death unaccompanied by torture?) Tj T*
