(     rage. Piracy, also, is another side of this proletarian) Tj T*
(     system. It found its strongest aliment in the system of) Tj T*
(     spoliation practiced by the Romans in Asia Minor. The) Tj T*
(     oppressed along the whole coast, joined the pirates) Tj T*
