(junction can frequently be not even seen. The amphitheatre of Pola has) Tj T*
(lost in two thousand years only two lines from the angles of the) Tj T*
(stones.[209-2] The Elgin marble statues would certainly have lasted) Tj T*
(longer in Greece than they will in England. On the other hand, warm and) Tj T*
(dry climates have a very peculiar and exceedingly frightful species of) Tj T*
(nature-consumption in the locust plagues. The principal countries) Tj T*
