(All these allegations are undoubtedly true, in so far as the whole world) Tj T*
(is considered one great economic system, and the aggregate of all goods,) Tj T*
(including the medium of circulation, is borne in mind. The consolation) Tj T*
(which might otherwise lie herein is made indeed to some extent) Tj T*
(unrealizable by these conditions. It must not be forgotten in practice) Tj T*
(that men are actuated by other motives than that of consuming as much as) Tj T*
(possible.[217-1] As men are constituted, the full consciousness of this) Tj T*
(possibility is not always found in connection with the mere power to do,) Tj T*
(to say nothing of the will to do.[217-2] There are, everywhere, certain) Tj T*
(consumption-customs corresponding with the distribution of the national) Tj T*
(income. Every great and sudden change in the latter is therefore wont to) Tj T*
(produce a great glut of the market.[217-3] The party who in such case) Tj T*
(wins, is not wont to extend his consumption as rapidly as the loser has) Tj T*
(to curtail his; partly for the reason that the former cannot calculate) Tj T*
(his profit as accurately as the latter can his loss.[217-4]) Tj T*
