(quality.[225-4] Since the knight could personally neither eat nor drink) Tj T*
(a quantity beyond the capacity of his own stomach, he kept a numerous) Tj T*
(suite to consume his surplus. It is well known what a great part was) Tj T*
(played among the ancient Germans by their retinues of devoted servants) Tj T*
