(noblemen.[225-5]) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The rich man welcomed every opportunity which enabled him to make others) Tj T*
(share in a dazzling manner the magnitude of his superfluous wealth:) Tj T*
(hence the numberless guests at weddings who were frequently entertained) Tj T*
(for weeks.[225-6] These festivities are memorable not because of the) Tj T*
(delicacies or great variety of the dishes, but because of their colossal) Tj T*
