("exquisite" may even with these outshine others by the form he selects,) Tj T*
(the material he wears, or by frequent change, but much less strikingly) Tj T*
(than before.[228-4] Since every one, in the purchase of household) Tj T*
(furniture, etc., looks more to its use than to the honor of being sole) Tj T*
(possessor of an article or having something in advance of everybody) Tj T*
(else, it becomes possible for industry to manufacture its products in) Tj T*
(much larger quantities, and after the same model, and thus to furnish a) Tj T*
(much better article for the same price.[228-5] Besides, more recent) Tj T*
(industry has produced a multitude of cheap substitutes for costly) Tj T*
(objects of luxury: plated silver-leafing, cotton-velvet goods,) Tj T*
(etc.;[228-6] besides the many steel engravings, lithographs etc., which) Tj T*
(have exerted so beneficent an influence on æsthetic education.) Tj T*
