(To judge of the salutariness of sumptuary laws, we must keep the above) Tj T*
(three social periods in view throughout. At the close of the first) Tj T*
(period, every law which restricts the excesses of the immediately) Tj T*
(succeeding age \(the middle age\) is useful because it promotes the noble) Tj T*
(luxury of the second period.[236-1] And so, in the third period,) Tj T*
