(odious forms of vice under cover, and thus to diminish their contagious) Tj T*
(seduction. It is a matter of significance that, in Rome, the most) Tj T*
(estimable of the emperors always endeavored to restrict luxury.[236-2]) Tj T*
(But too much should not be expected of such laws. _Intra animum medendum) Tj T*
(est; nos pudor in melius mutet._[236-3] It is at least necessary, that) Tj T*
