(also on the nature of the business carried on in them,[237d-7] and on) Tj T*
(the condition of the local development of fire police. Highly cultured) Tj T*
(places, especially large cities, are really much less exposed to damage) Tj T*
(from fire. To not take this into account would be not only to) Tj T*
(compulsorily dole out charity to the poorer classes of the people, and) Tj T*
(to the less cultivated portions of the country,[237d-8] but it would) Tj T*
(indirectly put an obstacle in the way of a transition to the massive) Tj T*
(construction of houses, and of good, that is, as a rule, of costly) Tj T*
(fire-extinguishing institutions.[237d-9] On the other hand,) Tj T*
(administration must be rendered much more difficult by the taking of) Tj T*
(risks of many degrees of danger, especially as it is scarcely possible,) Tj T*
(for a long time, to even hope for a statistically unassailable basis of) Tj T*
(a tariff graded in exact accordance with the risk.[237d-10] If those) Tj T*
(objects especially exposed to danger should be excluded altogether, the) Tj T*
(common utility of the institution would be largely diminished; and the) Tj T*
(insured least exposed to danger would nevertheless have to complain of a) Tj T*
(relatively too high contribution.[237d-11] If every peculiar class of) Tj T*
(risks were to be treated as one whole, the insuring principle itself) Tj T*
(would suffer.[237d-12] Where the nation or municipality engages in the) Tj T*
(business of compulsory insurance, its too rigid system of rate-fixing) Tj T*
(has something inequitable in it, inasmuch as it makes the most provident) Tj T*
(housekeeper suffer from the danger from fire of his neighbor's) Tj T*
(establishment, a gas factory, for instance.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(C. The certainty of compensation for damage suffered. The government) Tj T*
(should see to it that the institution does not promise more than it can) Tj T*
(perform with its joint-stock capital and by means of its) Tj T*
(premiums.[237d-13] The good will of foreign institutions to keep their) Tj T*
(promises to the letter is best assured by requiring them as a condition) Tj T*
(precedent of carrying on their business in a country, to bind themselves) Tj T*
(to litigate only in the home courts. They protect themselves against the) Tj T*
(risk of very large insurances by the system of re-insurance, by) Tj T*
(transferring a portion of the premium as well as of the risk to one or) Tj T*
(more other insurance companies.[237d-14]) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(D. In all highly cultured quarters, the almost entirely voluntary) Tj T*
(fire-extinguishing system, in which the people turned out in a body to) Tj T*
(battle with the flames, made way for the fire-militia system; and if the) Tj T*
(latter should make place for what we may designate as a standing) Tj T*
(fire-army which is most easily attained in connection with the) Tj T*
(fire-insurance system, we should reach the ideal of such a system,) Tj T*
(especially if the business of insurance was in the hands of the state or) Tj T*
(of the municipality. Such a system would be in accordance with the) Tj T*
(principle of the division of labor, and, also, with the fact that) Tj T*
(usually the most vital interest is the greatest spur to action.[237d-15]) Tj T*
