(     influence of a very intelligible reaction \(1st ed., 1798; 2d) Tj T*
(     ed., 1803\). For a whole generation, the European public had) Tj T*
(     had no other view broached but that the tree of human kind) Tj T*
(     might keep on growing even until it reached the heavens, if) Tj T*
(     care were only taken to manure the ground, to water the) Tj T*
(     roots and prune the branches according to the latest) Tj T*
(     world-improving recipes. _Malthus_, in opposition thereto,) Tj T*
(     called attention to the limits placed by nature to the) Tj T*
(     number of mankind. He demonstrated that it was not merely) Tj T*
(     arbitrary laws which opposed the Utopian happiness of all,) Tj T*
