(rule.[245-2] Vices of unchastity always limit the otherwise natural) Tj T*
(increase of population. Premature enjoyment exhausts the sources of) Tj T*
(fruitfulness in the case of many.[245-3] The life of the child conceived) Tj T*
(in sin is generally little valued by its parents. Hence the numerous) Tj T*
(instances of exposure and infanticide.[245-4] We have already seen how) Tj T*
(closely, psychologically speaking, a community of goods is allied to a) Tj T*
(community of women. \(§ 85.\) And, indeed, in the lower stages of) Tj T*
(civilization, we find as close an approximation to the latter as to the) Tj T*
(former; and it is difficult to believe that, among men living in a state) Tj T*
(of nudity, the marriage of one man to one woman could properly) Tj T*
(exist.[245-5] But it is as little possible to reconcile a community of) Tj T*
(women with density of population as great national wealth with a) Tj T*
(community of goods. Any one acquainted with the condition and capacities) Tj T*
(of new born children knows that the weak little flame easily goes out) Tj T*
