(and in the age of the Cæsars.[250-8] What to-day is called by many the) Tj T*
(emancipation of woman would ultimately end in the dissolution of the) Tj T*
(family, and, if carried out, render poor service to the majority of) Tj T*
(women. If man and woman were placed entirely on the same level, and if) Tj T*
